        <mxCell id="fk_label1" value="&lt;b&gt;Foreign Key Constraints:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• All FK relationships include CASCADE on update&lt;br/&gt;• Most FKs use RESTRICT on delete to prevent data loss&lt;br/&gt;• user_roles uses CASCADE on delete for cleanup&lt;br/&gt;• investment_returns uses CASCADE on delete&lt;br/&gt;• Soft deletes recommended for critical business data" style="align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1420" y="280" width="380" height="120" as="geometry" />
