        <mxCell id="rules_label1" value="&lt;b&gt;Business Rules:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Users must complete KYC before creating loans&lt;br/&gt;• Loans require admin approval before listing&lt;br/&gt;• Total investments cannot exceed loan amount&lt;br/&gt;• Credit scores expire after 90 days&lt;br/&gt;• Repayment schedules auto-generated on loan approval&lt;br/&gt;• Late fees calculated after 7-day grace period&lt;br/&gt;• Investment returns distributed proportionally" style="align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" parent="1" vertex="1">
